* >Natural Source Header 000000
* :Mode S
* :CP
* :LineIncrement 10
* <Natural Source Header
*              RMUNLOCK
* Version      3.5
* Function     Reset all lock flags in source records depending on
*              the order records attached to the source
*
* Template     RMRCSTMP
*
* Note         RMRCSTMP handles a lock mechanism to synchronize scan-
*              and copy-tasks. If the monitorabends, this routine will
*              reset the receipt stamps of all source records.
*              Note: not all source types are synchronized.
*
* Intern. docu ÖÖdaenus01ÖNaturalÖNat-AdtÖNAT-EsmÖProjectsÖNom35Ö...
*           ...Internal_DocumentationÖNOM_Task_Sync_Concept.pdf
*
* Maintenance
* uuu     yyyy-mm-dd iTrac       Action
* ----------------------------------------------------------------------
* fhi     2019-07-08 NOMALL-2287 Created.
* fhi     2019-08-19 NOMALL-2294 Unlock by setting all stamps to blank
* BLI     2020-02-14 NOMALL-2294 add BS2
* ----------------------------------------------------------------------
*
DEFINE DATA
* --------------------------------------- Parameters -------------------
LOCAL USING RMSPL--L
LOCAL USING RMSR---E
LOCAL USING RMODTY-E
LOCAL
*
1 SOURCE VIEW OF NRM-SOURCE
  2 SR-ID
  2 SR-RECEIPT-STAMP
  2 SR-SPOOL-ATTRIBUTES
*
1 OD VIEW OF NRM-ORDER
  2 OD-TYPE
  2 OD-SOURCE-ID
*
1 #L-CONTROL             (B66)
1 REDEFINE #L-CONTROL
  2 #L-TYPE (B2)
1 #NEW-STAMP             (A1)
1 #I                     (N1)
END-DEFINE
*
************************************************************************
* Main line
************************************************************************
*
MOVE SEQUENTIAL-FILE-UNIX TO #L-TYPE
FOR #I 1 TO 2
  IF #I EQ 2
    MOVE SEQUENTIAL-FILE-BS2 TO #L-TYPE
  END-IF
  RDSRC.
  READ SOURCE BY SR-CONTROL STARTING FROM #L-CONTROL
    #SPOOL-ATTRIBUTES := SR-SPOOL-ATTRIBUTES
    IF #SPOOL-TYPE NE #L-TYPE
      ESCAPE BOTTOM (RDSRC.)
    END-IF
    IF SR-RECEIPT-STAMP = ' '
      ESCAPE TOP                             /* already initial value
    END-IF
    GETSRC.
    GET SOURCE *ISN(RDSRC.)
    RESET SR-RECEIPT-STAMP
    UPDATE (GETSRC.)
    IF *COUNTER (RDSRC.) > 50
      RESET *COUNTER (RDSRC.)
      END TRANSACTION
    END-IF
  END-READ
END-FOR
END TRANSACTION
* ---------------------------------- end -------------------------------
END
